  "question": "The company provides customer service and has multiple customers. Each customer has a unique Customer ID, Name, Phone Number, and Email Address. The company offers various services to customers. Each service has a Service ID, Service Date, Description, and Fee, and is associated with a customer. After each service, the customer can provide satisfaction feedback, including a Rating and Feedback Comments.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0068\n\nCREATE TABLE `customer` (\n  `customer_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  `email_address` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`customer_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `service` (\n  `service_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `customer_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `service_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `description` varchar(1000) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `fee` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`service_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `service_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`customer_id`) REFERENCES `customer` (`customer_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `satisfaction_feedback` (\n  `feedback_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `service_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `rating` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `feedback_comments` varchar(2000) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`feedback_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `satisfaction_feedback_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`service_id`) REFERENCES `service` (`service_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
